319 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Vaccination is one of the most effective and affordable methods of preventing life-threatening diseases in children. Despite its importance, many healthcare centers in developing countries still rely on manual, paper-based systems to manage vaccination records. These traditional methods often result in challenges such as missing or misplaced records, delayed immunizations, human errors in calculating due dates, and difficulties in generating reports or sending timely reminders to parents.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
320 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To overcome these issues, VacciCare+ is designed as a web-based Child Vaccination Management System. Developed using Python \(Flask/Django\) for the backend and MySQL for secure data storage, the system integrates a simple yet responsive frontend built with HTML5, CSS \(Bootstrap\), and JavaScript. The platform allows parents to register their children, manage profiles, and book vaccination appointments with just a few clicks. Hospitals can update vaccination status, while administrators oversee records, approvals, and reports.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
